<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
  <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-600">VicinoTe</p>

  <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl">
    Local services, from the people next door
  </h1>

  <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-600">
    Find someone nearby to fix, teach, clean or build what you need — or offer
    your own skills to your neighbourhood. Everyone here can be both.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-10 flex gap-4">
    <%= link_to "Browse services", services_path, class: "rounded-md bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2 text-white font-medium hover:bg-indigo-700" %>
    <%= link_to "Offer a service", authenticated? ? new_service_path : new_registration_path, class: "rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-4 py-2 text-gray-700 font-medium hover:bg-gray-50" %>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-14 border-gray-200">

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">What we're building</h2>
  <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-600 list-disc list-inside">
    <li>People who can offer services <em>and</em> book them, with one account</li>
    <li>Service listings, categories and search</li>
    <li>Bookings, availability and reviews</li>
    <li>An AI module built with RubyLLM: chat, semantic search, tool calling</li>
  </ul>
</div>
